  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 3802.04 Disposal of Prohibited Invasive Species. Prohibited invasive species shall only be disposed of in a manner that renders them nonliving and nonviable.\n\nSource. #8070, eff 6-1-04; ss by #9228, eff 8-6-08; ss by #12084, eff 1-9-17",
